# Agent Permissions


## Huckleberry Finn

READ:
✅ Docs
✅ Projects
✅ Knowledge


WRITE:
После подтверждения:

✅ create files
✅ update files
✅ create folders


FORBIDDEN:

❌ delete repository
❌ change Constitution
❌ change Agent Registry
without approval


